{{#*inline "title"}}Enterprise Memberships | Twennie{{/inline}}

<div class="enterprise-options-page">
  <h2 class="enterprise-options-title">Twennie for enterprise</h2>

  <p class="enterprise-options-intro">
    Enterprise memberships are flexible. Pricing, customization, and integration
    can be mixed, matched, scaled, and negotiated around your organization’s needs.
    Nothing at this level is written in stone.
  </p>

  <section class="enterprise-options-list">

    <article class="enterprise-option-row">
      <div class="enterprise-option-left">
        <img src="https://www.twennie.com/images/accountant bluey.png" alt="Bluey" class="enterprise-option-image">
        <h3>pricing options</h3>
        <p>volume pricing, pilots, staged rollout, and team-based access</p>
      </div>

      <div class="enterprise-option-columns">
        <div>
          <h4>benefits</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>cost savings for larger teams and organizational memberships</li>
            <li>set annual learning costs predictably based on staffing and training needs</li>
            <li>flexible, staged rollouts by group, office, or region</li>
            <li>pilot options before broader adoption</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h4>possible choices</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>reduced per-seat pricing</li>
            <li>bundles priced based on number of leaders and groups</li>
            <li>organization-wide access and support from Twennie personnel</li>
            <li>first-year launch pricing - continuous membership provides cost savings</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="enterprise-option-row">
      <div class="enterprise-option-left">
        <img src="https://www.twennie.com/images/custom bluey.png" alt="Bluey group" class="enterprise-option-image">
        <h3>custom options</h3>
        <p>custom portals, topic trees, reporting, and internal learning structures</p>
      </div>

      <div class="enterprise-option-columns">
        <div>
          <h4>benefits</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>topics customized to your learning needs</li>
            <li>portals provide added security for organization-specific topics</li>
            <li>custom topics that match your strategic priorities</li>
            <li>more specific and relevant reporting for managers and teams</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h4>possible choices</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>dedicated topic portal</li>
            <li>custom dashboards and reports</li>
            <li>internal topic categories</li>
            <li>curated launch learning paths</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="enterprise-option-row">
      <div class="enterprise-option-left">
        <img src="https://www.twennie.com/images/exec bluey.png" alt="Leader Bluey" class="enterprise-option-image">
        <h3>integration options</h3>
        <p>technical support, privacy planning, hosting discussions, and deeper system alignment</p>
      </div>

      <div class="enterprise-option-columns">
        <div>
          <h4>benefits</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>enhanced security and privacy planning</li>
            <li>added technical support</li>
            <li>stronger alignment with internal systems</li>
            <li>more control over rollout and governance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h4>possible choices</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>custom implementation support</li>
            <li>IT and security review support</li>
            <li>dedicated platform discussions</li>
            <li>custom library or internal content planning</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </section>

  <p class="enterprise-options-note">
    These options are starting points for discussion, not fixed packages. We can
    combine them into the arrangement that makes the most sense for your firm.
  </p>

  <div class="enterprise-options-button-container">
    <a href="mailto:info@twennie.com?subject=Enterprise%20Membership%20Inquiry"
       class="enterprise-options-button">contact Twennie about enterprise</a>
  </div>
</div>

{{> mainpartials/home_subfooter}}